      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so looking closer at the part u mentioned about the popular vote... it seems like in a modern world where everyone's connected, having a system where the person with the most votes can still lose just feels outdated and fundamentally broken. can u write a detailed paragraph for my essay that explains why the electoral college is basically incompatible with modern democratic values? i want to really hammer home the argument that it's an obstacle to true equality.",
